  Skills tab and its world/skill registry data, Photos tab, OJBadge panel,
  Home Screen Buddy, route overlay and route skill page.
- Teach the run-route parsers English while keeping every Chinese branch:
  units, destinations, preferences, shape, cancellation and adjustments.
- Make the response language a server-owned policy in the prompt harness.
  Defaults to en; clients may request zh-CN / zh-TW from an allowlist and a
  client task instruction cannot override it. Contract and tests updated.
- Anchor .gcloudignore / .dockerignore directory rules to the repo root. Bare
  ios/hardware/android/dist matched at any depth and silently dropped
  scripts/ios, scripts/hardware, scripts/android and native/frost-badge/ios,
  which made a clean-checkout Cloud Build fail.
- Add docs/backend/CHANGE_TEST_DEPLOY.md covering verify, preflight, deploy,
  acceptance and rollback.

